  Many house systems are known; each one offers a method of calculating
them. In fact, there are more than 50 of them, for the most part devised
on theories or mere assumptions, indicating an insufficient scientific
foundation. And this is not a little astonishing, when one bears in mind
that houses are, next to the planets and the zodiacal signs, the most im
portant and basic factors in Astrology 1

  We set out to find the solution to the house division problem making
clean sweep of all the former theories, and proceeding, as the reader will
see, with thorough scientific rigour.

